 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Files are added with absolute paths (\"/a/b/name.ext\") and sizes; re-adding a path replaces its size. A file's name is its last component and its extension is the text after the last \".\" of the name (\"\" if none). find(directory, ...) considers files strictly below directory at any depth (\"/\" = all) and returns matching full paths sorted. Leaf filters: [\"sizeGreaterThan\", n] (size > n), [\"extension\", e], [\"namePrefix\", p]. Variant 1: filters is a list combined with AND (empty list matches all).",
  "provenance": [
